It's time for praise, get across even more

129
00:18:43,860 --> 00:18:46,810
伝われ目を離しちゃダメ
Get across, don't take your eyes off me

130
00:18:46,990 --> 00:18:49,440
もっと優しく 優しく 手をつないでいて
Hold my hand more gently, more gently

131
