179
00:25:00,535 --> 00:25:02,435
艶やかな暗闇に咲く葛藤と
With the inner conflict blooming in the enchanting dark...

180
00:25:04,685 --> 00:25:07,035
見つめ合っていたい不意に訪れる
We want to gaze at each other until it suddenly arrives.

181
00:25:09,235 --> 00:25:12,635
引き足の静けさに気づかないふりして
Pretending not to notice the quietness of our retreating steps,

182
00:25:14,335 --> 00:25:17,035
艶めくくらいの熱量に
In this enthralling, passionate heat...

183
00:25:17,385 --> 00:25:21,085
もう少し浮かれていたいな
I want to get carried away just a little longer.

184
00:25:21,585 --> 00:25:24,685
息を呑んで焼き付けて
Hold your breath and sear it into your heart,

185
00:25:25,235 --> 00:25:32,685
忘れられない夜の狂乱の宴を
This unforgettable night of chaotic festivity!

186
00:25:39,035 --> 00:25:41,985
最高の最後まで目を逸らさないで
Don't look away until the very end, until the absolute peak!

187
00:29:56,285 --> 00:30:01,333
[Title: ray] 作詩・作曲：藤原基央
[Title: ray] Lyrics & Music: Motoo Fujiwara

188
00:30:11,543 --> 00:30:17,803
お別れしたのは もっと前のことだったような
It feels like we said our goodbyes even longer ago than that...

189
00:30:18,363 --> 00:30:24,803
悲しい光は封じて かかと擦り減らしたんだ
I locked away the sorrowful light and wore down my heels.

190
00:30:25,363 --> 00:30:31,823
君といたときは見えた 今は見えなくなった
When I was with you I could see it, but now it's out of sight.

191
00:30:32,363 --> 00:30:38,823
透明な星屑をぼんやりと でもそれだけが探してる
Gazing blankly at the transparent stardust, yet that's all I'm searching for.

192
00:30:39,343 --> 00:30:45,803
しょっちゅう歌を歌ったよ その時だけのメロディを
I sang songs all the time, melodies meant just for that moment...

193
00:30:46,363 --> 00:30:52,823
寂しくなくなかったよ ちゃんと寂しくなれたから
It wasn't that I wasn't lonely, because I was finally able to feel truly lonely.

194
00:30:54,363 --> 00:31:01,823
いつまでのどこまでなんて 正常か異常かなんて
Wondering until when or how far, or whether it's normal or abnormal...

195
00:31:02,243 --> 00:31:08,803
考える暇もないほど 歩くのは大変だ ああ
Walking is hard enough without even having time to think about it, ah...

196
00:31:09,143 --> 00:31:15,823
楽しい方がずっといいよ ごまかして笑っていくよ
Having fun is always better, I'll gloss over it and keep smiling.

197
00:31:16,243 --> 00:31:22,803
大丈夫だ あの痛みは 忘れたって消えやしない
It's alright, that pain won't disappear even if I forget it.

198
00:31:23,363 --> 00:31:30,803
理想で作った道を 現実が塗り替えてくよ
Reality is painting over the path made of ideals.

199
00:31:31,143 --> 00:31:37,823
思い出はその奇跡の上で 輝きになって残ってる
Memories remain shining atop those miracles.

200
00:31:38,363 --> 00:31:44,803
お別れしたのはなんで 何のためだったんだろうな
I wonder why and for what purpose we said goodbye.

201
00:31:45,363 --> 00:31:51,823
悲しい光が僕の影を 前に長く伸ばしてる
The sorrowful light stretches my shadow far ahead.

202
00:31:52,363 --> 00:31:58,803
ドキドキねじがってるよ 時間がある時に眠るよ
My heart is winding up tight, I'll sleep when I have time.

203
00:31:59,343 --> 00:32:06,823
夢だとわかるその中で 君と会ってからまた行こう
Within a dream I know is a dream, let's meet and then go again.

204
00:32:07,243 --> 00:32:13,803
永遠とはほど遠い 終わらない暗闇にも
Even in an endless darkness, so far from eternity,

205
00:32:14,343 --> 00:32:20,823
星を思い浮かべたなら すぐ銀河の中だ ああ
If you picture the stars, you're right inside the galaxy, ah...

206
00:32:21,363 --> 00:32:28,803
甘えられなくなっても 靴を新しくしても
Even if I can't rely on others anymore, even with brand new shoes,

207
00:32:29,143 --> 00:32:35,823
大丈夫だ あの痛みは 忘れたって消えやしない
It's alright, that pain won't disappear even if I forget it.

208
00:32:36,363 --> 00:32:42,823
伝えたかったことが きっとあったんだろうな
