When I turned around, countless eyes were staring right at me.

259
00:44:31,132 --> 00:44:33,832
目指したのは 温かかった
What I aimed for was warm...

260
00:44:34,132 --> 00:44:36,852
私がいるはずの場所
The place where I should belong.

261
00:44:37,532 --> 00:44:43,532
目の前には ただ広がる まるで心の中みたいな
Before my eyes, it just spreads out, like the inside of my own heart.

262
00:44:44,412 --> 00:44:47,112
コンコンコンと扉の先
Knock, knock, knock, beyond the door...

263
00:44:47,332 --> 00:44:50,352
繰り返すループ こだました音
